New: DataOutInterface::write_vtu_in_parallel() and
DataOutInterface::write_vtu_with_pvtu_record() now take an additional
parameter of type DataOutBase::ParallelWriteMode. If set to
DataOutBase::ParallelWriteMode::send_to_rank_0, all participating ranks
send their data in sequence to rank 0, which then writes the file. This
avoids severe performance problems on network file systems that do not
properly support MPI IO.
